cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this work, please cite it as below."
title: "harness-kit"
abstract: >-
  A ledger-based safety net for multi-agent coding pipelines. The append-only
  hash-chained ledger is the single source of truth; derived state, attention
  routing and audits are computed from it, never declared by an agent. Only
  humans sign irreversible actions. Structural limits report instead of block.
